OL,3,AAsos says customers' personal
OL,4,Ainformation 'may have been accessed'
OL,5,Aafter message from hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos customer Lucy told the BBC they
OL,8,Fhave deleted "all my card information,
OL,9,Fchanged my password and address" from
OL,10,Fthe app. Another said she's worried the
OL,11,Fmessage may have "affected the
OL,12,Fintegrity of security" of her phone
OL,14,FDid you get the notification? Here's
OL,15,Fwhat you should do
